{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Lax方程"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“Lax 方程”"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>Lax 方程是形如\n$$\r\n\\frac{dL}{dt} = [M,L]\r\n$$\n的方程, 其中 $L,M$ 为线性算子. 它是方程组\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\t\\lambda \\psi &amp;= L \\psi \\\\\r\n\t\\frac{d\\psi}{dt} &amp;= M\\psi\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n的相容性条件.</p>\n"}}